# BC: staged 11 (read in place 4)
# BC0-NOT: read in place
# The top's accumulator inputs: the second registers, no read register.
# BCSIM-NOT: %Top_model_g_lane_{{[0-9]}}_lane_acc_read =
# TREE: staged 11 (read in place 5)
# SB: staged 13 (read in place 8); dead inputs 2 + {{[0-9]+}} in part ({{[0-9]+}} bits, no link)
# H0: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles in 1200 host cycles
# H60: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles in {{1383|1394}} host cycles
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
